  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1608.02 Principal Operator Certification: When Effective; Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1608.02 Principal Operator Certification: When Effective; Renewal.\n\n(a) Initial principal operator certification shall be effective for one year from the date of passing the examination.\n\n(b) Principal operator certification shall be renewed annually in accordance with Env-Sw 1611.\n\nSource. #10600, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13623, eff 5-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw1600.html"
